      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHATEVER THRILL (2) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.89 beating Oncidium. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Expected to go well again. SPACE INVADER (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (23.19) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record here including three wins. Has the ability to give this a shake. WARRIOR TOMMY (4) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 5 winner three back (24.41) at Traralgon over 425m. Can turn it around this time. ESSENDON FLYER (7) cannot be ruled out.",
